# box-drag-shift (h5-box): k's box dragged 30 px with Shift held throughout.
# Fine mode: a tenth of the rate with three decimals, the accent outline.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
hold Shift
move 331.5 494.5
down
move 361.5 494.5 over 80
shot box-drag-shift
up
release Shift
wait 1200
